{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Taro Tuber is a type of seed. Mature Plants yield ",["l","芋头","Taro Root"],"s."]],["p",["Taro Tubers can be obtained from ",["l","火山地牢","Common Chests"],", ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Tiger Slimes"],", or ",["l","熔岩掘地虫","Magma Duggies"]," in the ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],", from Tiger Slimes in the ",["l","姜岛","Tiger Slime Grove"],", from ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"],"s using ",["l","芋头","Taro Root"],"s, by breaking open ",["l","金色椰子","Golden Coconut"],"s, from the ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," for 2 ",["l","骨头碎片","Bone Fragment"],"s, from cutting ",["l","杂草","weeds"]," in ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island Jungle"],", from ",["l","狮子鱼","Lionfish"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"],"s when the population reaches 4, or from ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"]," ",["l","远古斑点","artifact spots"]," and ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]],["p",["Taro Tubers planted in most farm tiles take 10 days to mature with watering each day, as with other crops. However, Taro Tubers planted approximately within 3 tiles of a water source (such as a ",["l","农场池塘","Farm Pond"]," or a river) in any direction are considered to be irrigated, as in a paddy field. Paddies need not be continuous with each other or adjacent to water in order to count as irrigated. Irrigated Taro Tubers mature in 7 days and do not require watering."]]]],["Stages",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Type"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[[],[["f","Taro_Stage_1.png",45]],[["f","Taro_Stage_2.png",45]],[["f","Taro_Stage_3.png",45]],[["f","Taro_Stage_4.png",45]],[["f","Taro_Stage_5.png",45]]],[["Non-Irrigated"],["1 Day"],["2 Days"],["3 Days"],["4 Days"],["Total: 10 Days"]],[["Irrigated"],["1 Day"],["1 Day"],["2 Day"],["3 Days"],["Total: 7 Days"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["